artifacts. No native binary, embedded FFmpeg runtime, or external executable
is distributed or required by this package.

Modifications, 2026: ported packet entropy decoding, scan tables, integer IDCT,
and linearization to JavaScript typed arrays; added input and allocation limits,
explicit format errors, bounded tile reads/writes, cancellation, independent
packet ownership for async decoding, and a typed Bayer/metadata API. The packet
parser and public API are original implementations. The reference library's
threading, hardware acceleration, frame allocation, and libavcodec API are not
included in the executable JavaScript implementation.

